**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
../**
../../**
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/tsconfig.json
**/tsconfig.webview.json
**/vitest.config.mts
**/esbuild.js
**/knip.ts
**/src/

# The webview SOURCE tree. Everything that runs is bundled into out/ by
# esbuild, and package.json's main is ./out/extension.js — nothing loads a
# .ts or .svelte from here at runtime. Shipping it published 476 original
# source files, the phone shell's wire crypto among them (2026-09-12).
# NOTE: this is anchored at the package root on purpose. A leading **/ would
# also match out/webview/, which IS the runtime bundle.
webview/**

# Source maps rebuild the original source from the shipped bundle, so they
# leak exactly what the line above stops. extension.js.map alone was 3.5 MB
# of extension-host source.
**/*.map

# The README screenshot harness (scripts/readme-shots): a release tool, not
# part of the extension.
scripts/**

!.vscodeignore
